LOCATION:ICFP Amphitheatre, 4333 Côte-Ste-Catherine Rd., Montreal QC H3T 1E4
DESCRIPTION:Practice-oriented research: Expanding the scientific foundations of psychotherapy\n\nSpeaker: Louis Castonguay\nChair: Vincent Laliberté\nFormat: In-person\n\nLearning Objectives:\n•	Being able to identify different types of practice-oriented research and some of their points of convergences\n•	Acquiring knowledge about studies conduct within practice-research network\n•	Understanding some of the guiding principles underlying practice-oriented research
