SUMMARY:Clinical Grand Rounds - Medicolegal confinement: Theory and practice
LOCATION:ICFP G-23, 4333 Côte-Ste-Catherine Rd., Montreal QC H3T 1E4
DESCRIPTION:Medicolegal confinement: Theory and practice\n\nSpeaker: Sarah Benning\nChair: Nasr Farooqi\nFormat: In-person\n\nLearning Objectives:\n•	To review the medicolegal basis for confinement in hospital in Quebec.\n•	To review current hospital procedures and practices with regard to confinement. \n•	To review relevant recent case law.
